Package: vabaxos-vision
Architecture: all
Maintainer: VabaxOS <https://github.com/Vabax-dev/VabaxOS>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, gsettings-desktop-schemas
Recommends: libnotify-bin
Description: Zoom and contrast, with one key, said aloud
 For people who see a little: Super+Plus and Super+Minus zoom in and out
 (as Win+Plus and Win+Minus), Super+Ctrl+C turns high contrast on and
 off (as Win+Ctrl+C), Super+Ctrl+Plus and Super+Ctrl+Minus change the
 size of the text; each change is said by Orca, or shown in a short
 notification. The window adds inverted colours, black and white,
 cross-hairs, how the zoom follows the focus and the size of the pointer.
 Everything goes to GNOME's own settings.
